{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108307","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108307","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710830701:1":{"text":"バリアが作動した！さすがはディーズ！","source_cn":"屏障生效了！迪兹，你也太厉害了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84809FC4F66E945D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710830702:1":{"text":"喜ぶのは早いわよ。バリアはあくまでも防衛手段、魔物への攻撃には使えない。","source_cn":"别高兴得太早。屏障只能防御，不能攻击魔物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD14412B64B5E6C4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710830703:1":{"text":"守備軍の負担を減らすためにも、こちらから攻撃を仕掛けないと……","source_cn":"必须想办法主动出击，减轻守备军的压力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CF68A1133A2009","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710830704:1":{"text":"へ？こ、攻撃？僕と君で？","source_cn":"啊？主动出击？我们两个吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F91FFC75CD6183C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710830705:1":{"text":"……グウィネス隊長。もう一つ提案してもよろしいでしょうか？","source_cn":"……格温妮丝队长，关于这点我还有一个提议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3ECA784E0694B52B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710830706:1":{"text":"もちろんです。何でもおっしゃってください。","source_cn":"迪兹魔法师，请讲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0563C539DDEFDB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710830707:1":{"text":"サバンナは建都の際、戦に備えて、都市のいくつかの要所に<style=\"highlight\">防衛ゴーレム</style>を配置したのです。","source_cn":"赛凡纳在建城之初，为了应对战争，在城市的几个关键节点设...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA9339BB72C4F1FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710830708:1":{"text":"ゴーレム？広場の石像のこと？あれはただの飾りじゃなかったの？","source_cn":"魔像？你是说广场上的那些石像？那不是装饰品吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C663F752B9F3B76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710830709:1":{"text":"……この件が終わったら、『都市の魔法防衛史』を一から読み直しなさい。","source_cn":"……回去之后我一定要让你重修《城市魔法防御史》！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09A26BE56B27AB3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710830710:1":{"text":"とにかく、あれらは古の魔導兵器です。一度起動すれば、周囲の魔物を自動で索敵し、攻撃します。","source_cn":"其实那些是古老的魔法兵器，一旦唤醒，它们就会自动索敌并...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F1534F7D6C361B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710830711:1":{"text":"ですが、一つ欠点がありまして……","source_cn":"不过这种魔像有一些弊端……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA732154A2A33FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710830712:1":{"text":"欠点とは？","source_cn":"什么弊端？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB27B20A9CAC5DE80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710830713:1":{"text":"魔力駆動装置がオーバーヒートしやすく、稼働が長引くと自動停止して冷却モードへ移行するのです。","source_cn":"它们的魔力驱动装置容易过热，运作一段时间后，会自动停止...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DEA0CE3D2FA5CAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1710830714:1":{"text":"そうなると、ゴーレムに付いているスイッチを入れて、再起動させなければなりません。","source_cn":"到时候，需要有人手动再开启魔像旁的开关，再次强制唤醒，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25AEA3CB7893FE28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1710830715:1":{"text":"魔物に攻撃されている状況で、スイッチを入れに行くのですか？さすがに危険すぎますよ！","source_cn":"在魔物攻击的情况下，跑去再开启开关吗？那也太危险了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2626347199B2C7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1710830716:1":{"text":"それだけではありません。初回の起動時には、私とダリーがその場で魔法を使って起動させる必要があります。","source_cn":"不仅如此。初次唤醒它们，更需要我和达利在现场进行魔法激活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB86BEAF091E8CCA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1710830717:1":{"text":"その間は、移動することも、自分たちを守ることもできません。","source_cn":"在这个过程中，我们完全无法移动，也没办法保护自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A81918560C0D89A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1710830718:1":{"text":"分かりました。私が二人をゴーレムのもとまで送り届けます。","source_cn":"明白了。我来护送你们去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89C7F098E5FB3CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1710830719:1":{"text":"そして起動時の護衛と、その後の再起動も私に任せてください。","source_cn":"无论是激活时的护卫，还是后续的重启工作，都交给我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x565145A57C3811AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1710830720:1":{"text":"だめです！これ以上隊長に無理はさせられません！ここは私たちにやらせてください！","source_cn":"不行！队长！您已经透支了！这种任务让我们去就行！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AF270BF6DCD1F08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1710830721:1":{"text":"そうですよ！この命にかけても、メイジさんたちをお守りします！","source_cn":"对！我们哪怕拼上性命，也会保护好两位魔法师大人的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE504DBD767DBE69C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710830722:1":{"text":"却下します。魔物だらけの場所で長時間持ちこたえつつ、ゴーレムのスイッチまで操作しなければならないのですよ。","source_cn":"驳回。那里全是魔物，而且需要长时间坚守原地，甚至还要在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30417F06743088D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1710830723:1":{"text":"今のあなたたちには、魔物の猛攻に耐え切れるだけの装備も体力も残っていないはずです。","source_cn":"那种烈度的围攻，凭你们现在的装备和体力，根本守不住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F2B5975B94A578F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710830724:1":{"text":"ですが……！","source_cn":"可是……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6E0DD4E8B5DFC67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1710830725:1":{"text":"反論は許しません。確かに危険な任務です。ですが、だからこそ私自ら行かなければならないのです。","source_cn":"没有可是。这很危险，正因为危险，所以我才必须亲自去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74AEE94FCF325DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1710830726:1":{"text":"いいですか。バリアがあっても、人々の動揺は収まっていません。ここを守り抜きなさい。これは命令です！","source_cn":"听着，屏障虽然建立了，但民众还需要人安抚。守好这里，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E5E390DDC64887E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":""